# Build context for host/Containerfile (`podman build -f host/Containerfile .`).
# Only what the Containerfile copies goes in: the repo also holds the UI's
# node_modules, Rust target dirs and the host's secrets, none of which belong
# in the context. Secrets reach the image only through .build/secrets/
# (staged by host/build.sh), never straight from host/secrets/.
*
!host/etc
!host/usr
!.build/wadd
!.build/client-app
!.build/hud
!.build/secrets
!.build/ssh
**/__pycache__
